cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "WWII Unit Locations: a claim-based dataset of unit positions (Western Front, 1944)"
type: dataset
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-24"
authors:
  - family-names: "Starsman"
    given-names: "Raymond Scott"
    email: "scott@starsman.com"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/scottstarsman/UnitLocationData"
abstract: "Event-based, sourced claims about where World War II units were on given dates, with coordinates, precision, confidence, conflict handling and optional strength figures. Coverage so far: the Western Front, 6 June to 31 December 1944 (US Army army-group, army, corps and selected division milestones; selected British, Canadian and German units for June 1944)."
keywords:
  - World War II
  - military history
  - order of battle
  - Normandy
  - geospatial
